Ansvar Compliance Skills plugin — third-party / upstream attribution
=====================================================================

The Claude plugin bundles no original skill content. Every file under skills/ is
a byte-identical vendored copy of a SKILL.md published by Ansvar Systems AB:
skills 1-4 from their own public repositories, skills 5-14 (the workflow
skill library) as published at https://ansvar.eu/skills/<id>/SKILL.md from a
pinned source commit recorded in skills-manifest.json. The plugin adds only
packaging: the plugin manifest, the MCP server declaration, the sync script,
and the anti-drift CI gate that keeps the copies honest.

